  "response": {
    "html": "<h1 data-chunk-id=\"2374484a-ccfc-45ee-8500-cd8736478ad8\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;border-bottom:3px solid #0d47a1;padding-bottom:6px\">Nebula Drift - Mechanics</h1>\n<p data-chunk-id=\"65a58dbb-fbab-41c6-b2bc-b1c6eac3ecb2\" style=\"background-color:#e3f2fd;border-left:4px solid #1565c0;padding:8px 10px;font-size:9pt;color:#37474f\">Vantage Nine Studios - internal - sub-document of the Nebula Drift GDD. Source of truth for every tunable number.</p>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"e2ea1dce-e920-49a7-876f-0145c2f67bc1\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">How to read this document</h2>\n<p data-chunk-id=\"bf5eff43-08a5-495b-b0aa-9e48d969398a\" style=\"background-color:#e3f2fd;border-left:4px solid #1565c0;padding:8px 10px;font-size:9pt;color:#37474f\">One section per mechanic. Every tunable number in the game\nappears here exactly once and is referenced from the GDD as prose. If a number\nappears in two places, this one wins.</p>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"f0c80560-c1da-4e15-bb77-347cda0572ff\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Dash</h2>\n<table data-chunk-id=\"ff5ee209-c246-4830-8000-8ed86acbcf3b\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #37474f;font-family:Inter , Calibri , Arial , sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Parameter</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Value</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Design note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Distance</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">5.5 m</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Two tiles. Tuned so a dash clears the standard gap.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Cooldown</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">1.2 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Short enough to chain, long enough to read.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">I-frames</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">0.15 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Start of dash only.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"a1bd84bd-0036-42d6-8710-8ced91f4e7fd\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Wall-run</h2>\n<table data-chunk-id=\"4401409b-5395-4abf-b06a-9b4f0635cdd4\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #37474f;font-family:Inter , Calibri , Arial , sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Parameter</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Value</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Design note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Max duration</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">2.0 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Falls off rather than stopping dead.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Speed retained</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">85%</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Deliberately lossy: wall-run is a connector, not a route.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Re-attach window</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">0.4 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Allows a corner without a full reset.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"59b8beb9-395a-4950-bdb5-f79ff01d9ea6\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Grapple</h2>\n<table data-chunk-id=\"06f09bdd-ff90-446c-b44f-b75b5e2b802d\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #37474f;font-family:Inter , Calibri , Arial , sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Parameter</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Value</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Design note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Range</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">18 m</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Reads at speed; longer felt like teleporting.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Cooldown</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">8 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">The longest cooldown in the game. All level pacing assumes it.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Speed on release</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">140%</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">The only system that converts height into speed.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Attach angle</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">60 deg cone</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Forgiving, because the camera is not.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"53ec6293-e119-45b6-a98e-642ad3da838b\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Overheat pulse</h2>\n<table data-chunk-id=\"bcb51170-0275-483c-9f9c-c064d47ddcda\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #37474f;font-family:Inter , Calibri , Arial , sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Parameter</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Value</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Design note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Radius</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">4 m</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Defensive only. Never damages.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Cooldown</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">6 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Paced against the grapple so they compete.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Stagger duration</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">1.1 s</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Enough to route past, not enough to farm.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"0b295593-d025-4399-9d30-95fc9070fb28\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Salvage economy</h2>\n<table data-chunk-id=\"5d97913a-af19-492b-a3d4-f4db85556912\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #37474f;font-family:Inter , Calibri , Arial , sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Parameter</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Value</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Design note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Base yield per node</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">12 units</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Flat. Rarity lives in placement, not in rolls.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Upgrade cost curve</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">60 / 140 / 260</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Three tiers, no branching.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Decay on death</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">0%</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Death costs progress through the sector, not currency.</td></tr></tbody></table>",
